{"files": [{"id": 37855600, "name": "pbio.3001805.g003.tif", "size": 1183588, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/37855600", "supplied_md5": "a61f693924f3bc5f49a00309be3837eb", "computed_md5": "a61f693924f3bc5f49a00309be3837eb", "mimetype": "image/tiff"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 13955914, "full_name": "Jaewon Song", "first_name": "Jaewon", "last_name": "Song", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10319219, "full_name": "Ryan D. Chow", "first_name": "Ryan D.", "last_name": "Chow", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 14009135, "full_name": "Mario A. Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez", "first_name": "Mario A.", "last_name": "Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8200, "full_name": "Li Zhang", "first_name": "Li", "last_name": "Zhang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Li_Zhang", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955920, "full_name": "Skylar A. Loeb", "first_name": "Skylar A.", "last_name": "Loeb", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955923, "full_name": "Eui-Young So", "first_name": "Eui-Young", "last_name": "So", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955926, "full_name": "Olin D. Liang", "first_name": "Olin D.", "last_name": "Liang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 129621, "full_name": "Ping Ren", "first_name": "Ping", "last_name": "Ren", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 127044, "full_name": "Sidi Chen", "first_name": "Sidi", "last_name": "Chen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8677404, "full_name": "Craig B. Wilen", "first_name": "Craig B.", "last_name": "Wilen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 179163, "full_name": "Sanghyun Lee", "first_name": "Sanghyun", "last_name": "Lee", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/LRRC15_inhibits_ACE2-mediated_SARS-CoV-2_entry_/21330292", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>(<b>A</b>) HeLa-ACE2 cells were transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs and infected with VSV pseudoviruses, VSV\u0394G-S-SARS2 or VSV\u0394G-G. GFP signal was measured at 20 hpi by flow cytometry (<i>n</i> = 3). Representative of 3 independent experiments are shown. (<b>B</b>) HeLa-ACE2 cells expressing LRRC15 or empty vector were infected with VSV psuedoviruses and GFP signal was measured at 20 hpi by flow cytometry (<i>n</i> = 3). Representative of 3 independent experiments are shown. (<b>C</b>) Huh7.5 cells were transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs and infected with VSV\u0394G-S-SARS2. GFP signal was measured at 20 hpi by flow cytometry (<i>n</i> = 4). Representative of 3 independent experiments are shown. (<b>D</b>, <b>E</b>) HeLa-ACE2 (D) or Huh7.5 (E) were transduced with indicated activating sgRNAs and infected with icSARS-CoV-2 mNG at 1 MOI. Infected cell frequencies were measured by mNeonGreen expression at 24 hpi (<i>n</i> = 8). Representative of 2 (<b>D</b>) or 3 (<b>E</b>) independent experiments are shown. (<b>F</b>) LRRC15-induced or mock HeLa-ACE2 cells were infected with VSV pseudoviruses harboring spike proteins of different SARS-CoV-2 variants. GFP signal was measured at 20 hpi by flow cytometry (<i>n</i> = 3). (<b>G</b>) LRRC15-induced or mock HeLa-ACE2 cells were infected with VSV pseudoviruses harboring SARS-CoV-1 spike. GFP signal was measured at 20 hpi by flow cytometry (<i>n</i> = 3). Data represent means \u00b1 SD (<b>A</b>-<b>G</b>). Data were analyzed by one-way ANOVA with Dunnett multiple comparisons test (<b>A</b>, <b>C</b>, <b>E</b>) or unpaired two-tailed t test (<b>B</b>, <b>D</b>, <b>F</b>, <b>G</b>). ns, not significant; *<i>p</i> < 0.05; **<i>p</i> < 0.01; ***<i>p</i> < 0.001; ****<i>p</i> < 0.0001. For underlying data, see <b><a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805#pbio.3001805.s003\" target=\"_blank\">S3 Data</a></b>. ACE2, angiotensin-converting enzyme 2; GFP, green fluorescent protein; hpi, hours postinfection; LRRC15, leucin-rich repeat-containing 15; MOI, multiplicity of infection; SARS-CoV-1, Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome Coronavirus; SARS-CoV-2, Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome Coronavirus 2; sgRNA, single guide RNA; VSV, vesicular stomatitis virus.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 1183588, "created_date": "2022-10-13T18:04:49Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-13T06:56:21Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["inhibitory attachment factor", "div >< p", "although attachment factors", "regulates viral entry", "coreceptors facilitating entry", "lrrc15 directly binds", "identified human lrrc15", "converting enzyme 2", "human lung single", "2 cellular entry", "mediated viral entry", "entry receptor angiotensin", "lrrc15 inhibits sars", "2 entry", "mediated entry", "inhibits spike", "lrrc15 represents", "lrrc15 </", "trans </", "surface </", "spike protein", "protective role", "primarily detected", "physiological context", "particularly enriched", "moderate affinity", "largely unknown", "extensively studied", "binding domain", ">, suggesting", "19 patients"], "keywords": ["inhibitory attachment factor", "div >< p", "although attachment factors", "regulates viral entry", "coreceptors facilitating entry", "lrrc15 directly binds", "identified human lrrc15", "converting enzyme 2", "human lung single", "2 cellular entry", "mediated viral entry", "entry receptor angiotensin", "lrrc15 inhibits sars", "2 entry", "mediated entry", "inhibits spike", "lrrc15 represents", "lrrc15 </", "trans </", "surface </", "spike protein", "protective role", "primarily detected", "physiological context", "particularly enriched", "moderate affinity", "largely unknown", "extensively studied", "binding domain", ">, suggesting", "19 patients"], "categories": [{"id": 4, "title": "Biochemistry", "parent_id": 38, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 12, "title": "Cell Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 14, "title": "Molecular Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 19, "title": "Pharmacology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 46, "title": "Immunology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 734, "title": "Biological Sciences not elsewhere classified", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 64, "title": "Cancer", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 132, "title": "Infectious Diseases", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 134, "title": "Virology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}], "references": ["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805"], "has_linked_file": false, "citation": "Song, Jaewon; Chow, Ryan D.; Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez, Mario A.; Zhang, Li; Loeb, Skylar A.; So, Eui-Young; et al. (2022). LRRC15 inhibits ACE2-mediated SARS-CoV-2 entry.. PLOS Biology. Figure. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805.g003", "related_materials": [{"id": 76501494, "identifier": "10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805", "title": "LRRC15 inhibits SARS-CoV-2 cellular entry in trans", "relation": "IsSupplementTo", "identifier_type": "DOI", "is_linkout": true, "link": "https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805"}], "is_embargoed": false, "embargo_date": null, "embargo_type": null, "embargo_title": "", "embargo_reason": "", "embargo_options": [], "id": 21330292, "title": "LRRC15 inhibits ACE2-mediated SARS-CoV-2 entry.", "doi": "10.1